{"3986110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape from Ruin: Greymart Simulator", "steam_appid": 3986110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ The game is not released yet. Any third-party download link may be a scam or malware — please only trust the official Steam page.<strong><br><br>👉 <u>Add to Wishlist</u> and join our Discord for early test notifications.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👉 Find the Discord invite link on the right.</strong>   <strong>👉</strong><br><br>In the ruins of a world overrun by the undead, you are no hero—just a scavenger chasing the faint promise of survival amid gunfire and decay. By day, venture into dangerous ruins for intense<strong><u> “loot, fight, and extract”</u></strong> runs—scour for supplies, fend off the infected, and escape with whatever you can carry. By night, return to your refuge inside an abandoned mall and manage your own <strong><u>black-market shop</u></strong>: sell your hard-earned loot to survivors, take on contracts, and trade or cooperate with other merchants. Expand your store, upgrade your equipment, and strengthen your skills to increase your chances of survival. In this crumbling world, there are no saviors—only those daring enough to risk everything, carving their own legend from the ashes of the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve a Path Through the Undead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city swarms with danger. As a cold-blooded scavenger, fight your way through hordes of zombies with precision shots and relentless firepower. Feel the rush as blood, smoke, and muzzle flashes blend into pure survival adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/5278bf63e8865765dbe8acfd8d8e6d4f.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/5278bf63e8865765dbe8acfd8d8e6d4f.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/5278bf63e8865765dbe8acfd8d8e6d4f.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Thrill of Looting the Ruins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the wasteland, courage and luck are your greatest weapons. Search through debris, crack open safes, and uncover rare treasures—gold bars, rare chips, valuable components. Each discovery delivers that addictive “loot rush” that keeps you diving back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/7628cc9e180b255b82c367a8f183cba9.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/7628cc9e180b255b82c367a8f183cba9.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/7628cc9e180b255b82c367a8f183cba9.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Joy of Running a Black-Market Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the lights of your refuge flicker to life. Display your hard-won loot, haggle with customers, and watch your earnings grow. Every sale feels like a small victory in a world where survival itself is currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/3bfa005f17d01ae5f48c86c9226af89c.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/3bfa005f17d01ae5f48c86c9226af89c.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/3bfa005f17d01ae5f48c86c9226af89c.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade with Merchants, Travel with Your Canine Partner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the refuge, you can trade and accept missions from merchants—or buy a loyal dog to accompany you on scavenging trips. Your canine companion guards your loot and carries valuable items as a living “safe box.” In this dying world, loyalty is the rarest treasure of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/b0259fbf8c0025ca0410c200ef1eed53.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/b0259fbf8c0025ca0410c200ef1eed53.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/b0259fbf8c0025ca0410c200ef1eed53.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair and Reforge for Greater Profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your generator powers the refuge, while your forge and tools restore broken gear and damaged loot. Rusted weapons and worn-out devices can be repaired, refined, and sold for higher prices on the black market. In the ruins, true wealth isn’t found—it’s remade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/a275b2de5183eeffda91343ba564ca36.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/a275b2de5183eeffda91343ba564ca36.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/a275b2de5183eeffda91343ba564ca36.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Danger Lurks Beneath the Market Lights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every customer is what they seem. In a world plagued by infection, a simple transaction can turn into chaos. One moment you’re making a sale, the next your shop is overrun by the undead. Defend your store—or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/ade7d0a61e5dc2e3439d240974e90034.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/ade7d0a61e5dc2e3439d240974e90034.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/ade7d0a61e5dc2e3439d240974e90034.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Mystery Crates for Unexpected Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the black market, you can purchase mystery crates filled with unknown goods. Inside might be rare weapons, valuable materials, or something entirely unexpected. Each unboxing is a gamble between fortune and fate—just like surviving in the wasteland itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/0ff5a8ddaf8b9e9439d08e78ab43056d.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/0ff5a8ddaf8b9e9439d08e78ab43056d.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/0ff5a8ddaf8b9e9439d08e78ab43056d.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ The game is not released yet. Any third-party download link may be a scam or malware — please only trust the official Steam page.<strong><br><br>👉 <u>Add to Wishlist</u> and join our Discord for early test notifications.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👉 Find the Discord invite link on the right.</strong>   <strong>👉</strong><br><br>In the ruins of a world overrun by the undead, you are no hero—just a scavenger chasing the faint promise of survival amid gunfire and decay. By day, venture into dangerous ruins for intense<strong><u> “loot, fight, and extract”</u></strong> runs—scour for supplies, fend off the infected, and escape with whatever you can carry. By night, return to your refuge inside an abandoned mall and manage your own <strong><u>black-market shop</u></strong>: sell your hard-earned loot to survivors, take on contracts, and trade or cooperate with other merchants. Expand your store, upgrade your equipment, and strengthen your skills to increase your chances of survival. In this crumbling world, there are no saviors—only those daring enough to risk everything, carving their own legend from the ashes of the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve a Path Through the Undead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city swarms with danger. As a cold-blooded scavenger, fight your way t