t</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your generator powers the refuge, while your forge and tools restore broken gear and damaged loot. Rusted weapons and worn-out devices can be repaired, refined, and sold for higher prices on the black market. In the ruins, true wealth isn’t found—it’s remade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/a275b2de5183eeffda91343ba564ca36.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/a275b2de5183eeffda91343ba564ca36.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/a275b2de5183eeffda91343ba564ca36.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Danger Lurks Beneath the Market Lights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every customer is what they seem. In a world plagued by infection, a simple transaction can turn into chaos. One moment you’re making a sale, the next your shop is overrun by the undead. Defend your store—or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/ade7d0a61e5dc2e3439d240974e90034.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/ade7d0a61e5dc2e3439d240974e90034.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/ade7d0a61e5dc2e3439d240974e90034.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Mystery Crates for Unexpected Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the black market, you can purchase mystery crates filled with unknown goods. Inside might be rare weapons, valuable materials, or something entirely unexpected. Each unboxing is a gamble between fortune and fate—just like surviving in the wasteland itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/0ff5a8ddaf8b9e9439d08e78ab43056d.poster.avif?t=1787107197\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/0ff5a8ddaf8b9e9439d08e78ab43056d.webm?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/extras/0ff5a8ddaf8b9e9439d08e78ab43056d.mp4?t=1787107197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A post-apocalyptic loot-fight-extract survival game with escape-style raids by day and black-market shop management by night. Fans of Tarkov-like gameplay — and players who love running management sims — will feel right at home.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Turkish, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Arabic, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/c4eabf40abc99ab92d1b9a524f78662e49531f0b/header.jpg?t=1787107197", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986110/e90837136da93213a96e4a1ea91c030d66011a0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787107197", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c